C1 V_control N001 4.7n
X§U1 N003 N001 Vcc+ Vcc- V_control level1 Avol=1Meg GBW=10Meg Vos=0 En=0 Enk=0 In=0 Ink=0 Rin=500Meg
V4 I_ref I_meas+ PWL(0 0 0.5 1 1 0 4 5)
