.tran 0 10 0 1E-4
* V_control=10V; Diode does not conduct; 6V into the V_gate;MOSFET closed; 30V in the load
* V_control=-10V; Diode conduct; -9.3V(10V-0.7) into the V_gate;MOSFET open;0V in the load
* In R1, it drops difference voltage (-9.3)-6=-15V
* With PULSE in V_control
* With PWL ramp in V_control
* Para este MOSFET: La region lineal esta entre 1.4-1.8V: Antes completamente abierto, despues, completamente cerrado\nLa pregunta: yo estoy jugando con la region lineal? 0 estoy encendiendo y apagando (como un calentador); En ese caso? Tengo una frecuencia fija? O no?\nPara esto, poner en lazo abierto control de voltaje
.option gminsteps=0
* CONCLUSION: It acts in the linear region of the MOSFET: MOSFET is not switching\nThe maximum voltage in V_diff is going to be 2.5V (So it does not saturate mosfet)\nVoltage in the output of the integrator just control dv/dt, does not saturate to voltage rate
